        "description": "Capture the real Postman response as naive-10.png. Use the authenticated dedicated seeded experiment server. Header test names display observed counts; they do not derive SQL counts from page size. Individual Send checks the current response. Run all requests once in listed order in the functional Collection Runner for paired-payload equality. These capture requests are outside the selected 180-request benchmark."
      },
      "response": []
    },
